# Supabase project settings
# Find these in your Supabase project: Project Settings -> API
# Both are safe to expose to the browser (that's what NEXT_PUBLIC_ means) -
# write access is enforced server-side by Postgres Row Level Security policies,
# not by keeping these secret.

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
